<page-meta page-style="{{themeStyle}}"/><view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="card">正在同步权益与训练记录…</view><view wx:elif="{{error}}" class="card"><view>{{error}}</view><button bindtap="load">重新加载</button><button data-url="/pages/profile/profile" bindtap="go">我的档案</button></view><block wx:else><view wx:if="{{owned}}" class="card"><view class="title">六周增力处方生成器</view><view class="muted">填能标准完成 4×8 的实测重量；随时按最新水平重算。</view><picker range="{{lifts}}" value="{{liftIndex}}" bindchange="lift"><view class="picker">{{lifts[liftIndex]}} ›</view></picker><input type="digit" placeholder="实测重量 kg" value="{{weight}}" data-k="weight" bindinput="field"/><picker range="{{steps}}" value="{{stepIndex}}" bindchange="step"><view class="picker">{{steps[stepIndex]}} ›</view></picker><button class="btn" bindtap="generate">生成六周处方</button><rich-text wx:if="{{generated}}" nodes="{{generated}}"/></view><view class="card"><rich-text nodes="{{body}}"/></view><view wx:if="{{!owned}}" class="card"><view class="title">{{payment}}</view><view class="muted">点下方按钮微信支付开通，支付后秒到账；权益由服务端核销。</view><button class="btn" style="margin:10rpx 0" data-p="plus1" bindtap="vpBuy">微信支付立即开通</button><input placeholder="输入开通码" value="{{code}}" data-k="code" bindinput="field"/><button class="btn" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy}}" bindtap="redeem">兑换并解锁</button></view><view class="card"><view class="title">相关工具</view><button class="btn ghost" data-url="/pages/today/today" bindtap="go">今日训练</button><button class="btn ghost" data-url="/pages/diet/diet" bindtap="go">今日饮食</button><button class="btn ghost" data-url="/pages/ai/ai" bindtap="go">随身导师 · 免费可用</button><button class="btn ghost" data-url="/subpkgs/tools/pages/plus/plus" bindtap="go">进阶工具包</button><button class="btn ghost" data-url="/subpkgs/tools/pages/plan12/plan12" bindtap="go">十二周计划</button></view></block>